<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 5.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 5.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				 Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     15.47    5.17</p>
<p> 2   Hills Inds	     13.98    1.86</p>
<p> 3   Mt Leyshon Gold	10.78    2.32</p>
<p> 4   Indu Property	   9.89    0.92</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.61    1.02</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	   9.60    1.70</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 9.50    1.07</p>
<p> 8   Aust Tour		 9.49    0.79</p>
<p> 9   Villa World	     9.40    1.17</p>
<p>10   Spotless Svc	    9.40    1.17</p>
<p>11   Centro Prop	     8.94    2.18</p>
<p>12   Gandel Retail Tr	8.86    0.88</p>
<p>13   Colonial Mutual	 8.76    1.18</p>
<p>14   Colonial Coml	   8.35    2.21</p>
<p>15   Barclays Mirvac	 8.34    1.32</p>
<p>16   Gen Prop Tr	     8.33    2.39</p>
<p>17   Schroder Prop	   8.15    2.27</p>
<p>18   Natl In Prop	    8.12    1.03</p>
<p>19   Advance Pro CB	  8.06    1.44</p>
<p>20   David Jones	     8.05    1.49</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
